abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifacts for a leakage-controlled independent UNSW-NB15
  replication of an evidence-governed explainable intrusion-detection protocol,
  including exact TreeSHAP faithfulness evaluation, ONNX equivalence and latency,
  and a validation-selected 20-tree explanation surrogate (TSES-20).
